<title>HONG KONG: HK Futures Exchange keeps top officials.</title>
<headline>HK Futures Exchange keeps top officials.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong Futures Exchange said in a statement on Friday its chairman Frank Wong was re-elected by the board to his position for another year.</p>
<p>Leong Siu Wing and Yeh Meou Tsen were also re-elected as vice-chairmen for another year, it said. --Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
